# --- Model weights: redistribution NOT cleared (see NOTICE) -----------------
# Trained weights are ASL Citizen / WLASL derived and are local-only until
# written authorization is recorded in NOTICE. They must not be published by
# a plain `git add`. Model LABELS and META are small interface files and are
# intentionally published (see models/README).
*.tflite
*.task
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

